number: XII
name: The Loam
path: M1 6h2.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0H11M1 8.5h10
uprightMeaning: fertile dark, slow harvest
reversedMeaning: exhausted soil, fallow, hunger
tags: season:autumn, element:earth, gem:emerald, flower:tulip
flavor: The soil is dark. The hand that turns it is darker.

--- upright
The roots go deeper than the frost. What was buried is still down there. What was planted is taking its time.
---

--- reversed
The soil has given what it can. The next crop will pull from somewhere else. The hand that planted does not know yet.
---
